@HostAddress = http://localhost:5171

### 1. Convert Length: 10 Meters to Feet (GET)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/unitconversion/convert?value=10&from=meters&to=feet&precision=4
Accept: application/json

### 2. Convert Temperature: 100 Celsius to Fahrenheit (GET)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/unitconversion/convert?value=100&from=celsius&to=fahrenheit
Accept: application/json

### 3. Convert Weight/Mass: 5 Kilograms to Pounds (POST)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/unitconversion/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 5,
  "from": "kilograms",
  "to": "pounds",
  "precision": 4
}

### 4. Get All Categories and Supported Units
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/unitconversion/categories
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Units Filtered by Category (e.g., length, temperature, mass, weight)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/unitconversion/units?category=length
Accept: application/json
